OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity restored to all of NI
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectricity has been restored to all
OL,7,Fproperties across Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fafter Storm Boelo, Northern Ireland
OL,9,FElectricity Networks (NIE) has said.
OL,11,FAt the weekend, the storm saw gusts of
OL,12,Fwind reach almost 80mph in some areas
OL,13,Fand led to flights and ferries being
OL,14,Fcancelled.
OL,16,FA Met Office yellow warning for strong
OL,17,Fwinds, mainly along the Antrim and Down
OL,18,Fcoasts, lasts from 18:00 GMT on Monday
OL,19,Funtil 03:00 Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
