OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity restored to all of NI
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile in the Republic of Ireland,
OL,7,Fan ESB spokesperson said there are "a
OL,8,Fnumber of homes, farms and businesses
OL,9,Fstill without electricity" on Monday
OL,10,Fmorning, and that teams are working to
OL,11,Frestore the power to all properties.
